-    sensor classes expected for the controlled domain, and semantic locality. RL rewards still
-    decide the policy; selection only determines which context is represented explicitly.
+    Existing automations and historical precursors remain useful upstream hints, but for
+    lighting a dedicated same-area/same-device occupancy sensor must not be crowded out
+    by a neighbouring-room sensor that happens to fire often. Remote cues may accelerate
+    ON; local occupancy remains the strongest evidence for maintaining/releasing the room.
     """
     target = agent["target_entity"]
     domain = target.split(".", 1)[0]
